  "bodyHash": "+6EbOWdrJKc=",
  "content": "<center>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gxSiDoVF/images/f9e7c79f2af4e24468044e1faa62bb78f2bd80ee.png\" width=\"840\" height=\"105\" /></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zZwEA08D/images/c9fda40b859cdef9563019bdca6bf6da06c01277.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"115\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff6600;\">***&nbsp;<a style=\"color: #ff6600;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/shetiphiancore\" rel=\"nofollow\">ShetiPhianCore</a> 為必要模組！ ***</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">將物品儲存在另一個維度。</span></p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>點擊查看合成配方+</summary>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gxSiDoVF/images/c877b9a4011735d5730bb0478e9c7b91a6315a4e.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"142\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gxSiDoVF/images/cef180c1326adade0d5a5736afd5d2b3430f5207.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"142\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gxSiDoVF/images/18a12a9edc14355d60bf2ee22b2c5dfab2daf4d6.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"142\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>網路系統</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">箱子僅在顏色和擁有權皆匹配時才會連結。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">手持染料並按住 Shift 右鍵點擊以更改每個環帶的顏色。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">在全局儲存槽上手持鑽石或綠寶石並按住 Shift 右鍵點擊以更改擁有權。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">按住 Shift 撿起物品以移除擁有權。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>全局網路 <span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #ffcc00;\">(金色)</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">任何人都可以使用此網路。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>私人網路 <span style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #00ffff;\">(鑽石)</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">個人專屬顏色。無需擔心他人使用何種顏色。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>團隊網路 <span style=\"color: #339966; font-size: 12px;\">(綠寶石)</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">允許同一團隊的成員共享。儲存槽顏色為您團隊專屬。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">請參閱 <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shetiphiancore/pages/spc-teams\"><span style=\"color: #3366ff;\">spc-teams</span></a> 頁面以獲取設定幫助。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>升級系統</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">手持升級物品並按住 Shift 右鍵點擊以應用。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">初始容量為 9 格。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">終界珍珠可增加 3 格，終界之眼可增加 9 格，最高可達 27 格。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">容量升級為永久性，並應用於當前擁有者/顏色配置。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>請查看模組配置以更改數值。</strong></p>\n</details>\n\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zZwEA08D/images/10d7dda31fa8d60f6246523f97ab9e30084be830.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"85\" /></p>\n<p><span><font size=6><strong>終界箱子</strong></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">所有相同顏色的箱子始終相互連接。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">提供全局、個人和團隊類型。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">手持染料並按住 Shift 右鍵點擊箱子以更改環帶顏色。</span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gxSiDoVF/images/6b516a8fbb1376eb1e70c11b5c5a42b48bc47519.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"459\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zZwEA08D/images/10d7dda31fa8d60f6246523f97ab9e30084be830.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"85\" /></p>\n<p><span><font size=6><strong>終界袋</strong></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">[右鍵] 開啟原版終界箱。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">[左鍵] 連結至箱子，方便存取儲存物品。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">按住 Shift 右鍵點擊箱子以連結。</span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gxSiDoVF/images/cc30b290debeb74735e4bf2a2b17285fc1b8bb13.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"473\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zZwEA08D/images/10d7dda31fa8d60f6246523f97ab9e30084be830.png\" width=\"640\" height=\"70\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>請在 <a href=\"https://github.com/ShetiPhian/Localizations-and-Issues\">GitHub</a> 上提交在地化檔案。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>發現錯誤？請使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/ShetiPhian/Localizations-and-Issues/issues\">問題追蹤器</a>。</strong></p>\n</center>",
